<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia unchanged at 1.869 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia unchanged at 1.869 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.869 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    November 18	  November 15</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.869		  1.869</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $4,84 million	    $5,11 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
